{"4102900": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Crystal Crepes: Tales of Food and Magic", "steam_appid": 4102900, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4102900/extras/ff529e1f852de70c458844f2f94a1c93.avif?t=1760733424\" width=1560 height=218 /></span><strong>Welcome to Crystal Crepes: Tales of Food and Magic!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into a magical fantasy world through the kitchen of <strong>Ivory Rock</strong>, where every dish tells a story. Meet a variety of characters and discover recipes from across the world, learning how to prepare them as you serve travelers and customers from distant lands. Experience the world through the stories of others, witness their intertwined tales unfold through a chronological narrative, collect recipes, and become <strong>the greatest Chef in all of Proxima Valyr.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Just be careful not to burn the crepes in the process!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4102900/extras/fcc844deffa4a09b43742ebe88d716c1.poster.avif?t=1760733424\" width=1170 height=536 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4102900/extras/fcc844deffa4a09b43742ebe88d716c1.webm?t=1760733424\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4102900/extras/bc0f5c6c0408d9e50208c7bad4a8d669.avif?t=1760733424\" width=1560 height=218 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ingredients are hidden throughout the world, each carrying unique traits that subtly reflect the nature of the regions they come from. From behind the kitchen counter, you can’t explore these lands yourself, so you’ll have to rely on your customers to bring you new recipes and rare ingredients. Every ingredient has a story to tell!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4102900/extras/f88f997f458d9a48d42e4a3c815ab80d.poster.avif?t=1760733424\" width=1170 height=536 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4102900/extras/f88f997f458d9a48d42e4a3c815ab80d.webm?t=1760733424\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4102900/extras/d300e4fe82d371290a90858662706451.avif?t=1760733424\" width=1560 height=218 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The kitchen of Ivory Rock is a reflection of a magical world, where every tool and element holds a spark of the arcane. Mastering their use is what separates a mere cook from an Arcane Chef! But don’t focus only on the cooking itself, during preparation, you’ll need to complete as many steps as possible to finish each dish perfectly. Don’t forget your Recipe Book, which holds all the knowledge you’ll need for your culinary creations.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4102900/extras/153119d795cc47ac73bfef221c78957a.poster.avif?t=1760733424\" width=1170 height=536 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4102900/extras/153119d795cc47ac73bfef221c78957a.webm?t=1760733424\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4102900/extras/4468ae76c2701ae6030c15134d2657f8.avif?t=1760733424\" width=1560 height=218 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Throughout your journey, you’ll unlock new kitchen elements, from recipes to special ingredients, each with their own story. At the end of each day, characters will visit and share tales from beyond the restaurant walls. You may encounter up to three unique visitors, their appearance depending on your daily performance.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4102900/extras/eb3ebc1462103630de1657c300d6215e.poster.avif?t=1760733424\" width=1170 height=536 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4102900/extras/eb3ebc1462103630de1657c300d6215e.webm?t=1760733424\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4102900/extras/bcf7f538a73aad08be58c50ca85973fa.avif?t=1760733424\" width=1560 height=218 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From the magical land of Proxima Valyr, within the restaurant Ivory Rock, you take on the role of Head Chef, chosen by the Starlight Guild. It’s your duty to uphold the guild’s prestigious reputation. During your service, you’ll meet a diverse array of customers from all walks of life, each with their own adventures, mysteries, and stories to share. The more people you meet, the more questions will arise...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>What happened to the previous Chef?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>What grants the Crystals their magical power?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>And what are the mysterious Cappies?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The answers lie in the hearts — and appetites — of your guests.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4102900/extras/d32fd0ee362c7992f3dabe7e0560b963.poster.avif?t=1760733424\" width=1170 height=536 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4102900/extras/d32fd0ee362c7992f3dabe7e0560b963.webm?t=1760733424\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4102900/extras/ff529e1f852de70c458844f2f94a1c93.avif?t=1760733424\" width=1560 height=218 /></span><strong>Welcome to Crystal Crepes: Tales of Food and Magic!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into a magical fantasy world through the kitchen of <strong>Ivory Rock</strong>, where every dish tells a story. Meet a variety of characters and discover recipes from across the world, learning how to prepare them as you serve travelers and customers from distant lands. Experience the world through the stories of others, witness their intertwined tales unfold through a chronological narrative, collect recipes, and become <strong>the greatest Chef in all of Proxima Valyr.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Just be careful not to burn the crepes in the process!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4102900/extras/fcc844deffa4a09b43742ebe88d716c1.poster.avif?t=1760733424\" width=1170 height=536 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4102900/extras/fcc844deffa4a09b43742ebe88d716c1.webm?t=1760733424\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4102900/extras/bc0f5c6c0408d9e50208c7bad4a8d669.avif?t=1760733424\" width=1560 height=218 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ingredients are hidden throughout the world, each carrying unique traits that subtly reflect the nature of the regions they come from. From behind the kitchen counter, you can’t explore these lands yourself, so you’ll have to rely on your customers to bring you new recipes and rare ingredients. Every ingredient has a story to tell!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4102900/extras/f88f997f458d9a48d42e4a3c815ab80d.poster.avif?t=1760733424\" width=1170 height=536 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4102900/extras/f88f997f458d9a48d42e4a3c815ab80d.webm?t=1760733424\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4102900/extras/d300e4fe82d371290a90858662706451.avif?t=1760733424\" width=1560 height=218 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The kitchen of Ivory Rock is a reflection of a magical world, where every tool and element holds a spark of the arcane. Mastering their use is what separates a mere cook from an Arcane Chef! But don’t focus only on the cooking itself, during preparation, you’ll need to complete as many steps as possible to finish each dish perfectly. Don’t forget your Recipe Book, which holds all the knowledge you’ll need for your culinary creations.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4102900/extras/153119d795cc47ac73bfef221c78957a.poster.avif?t=1760733424\" width=1170 height=536 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4102900/extras/153119d795cc47ac73bfef221c78957a.webm?t=1760733424\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4102900/extras/4468ae76c2701ae6030c15134d2657f8.avif?t=1760733424\" width=1560 height=218 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Throughout your journey, you’ll unlock new kitchen elements, from recipes to special ingredients, each with their own story. At the end of each day, characters will visit and share tales from beyond the restaurant walls. You may encounter up to three unique visitors, their appearance depending on your daily performance.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4102900/extras/eb3ebc1462103630de1657c300d6215e.poster.avif?t=1760733424\" width=1170 height=536 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4102900/extras/eb3ebc1462103630de1657c300d6215e.webm?t=1760733424\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4102900/extras/bcf7f538a73aad08be58c50ca85973fa.avif?t=1760733424\" width=1560 height=218 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From the magical land of Proxima Valyr, within the restaurant Ivory Rock, you take on the role of Head Chef, chosen by the Starlight Guild. It’s your duty to uphold the guild’s prestigious reputation. During your service, you’ll meet a diverse array of customers from all walks of life, each with their own adventures, mysteries, and stories to share. The more people you meet, the more questions will arise...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>What happened to the previous Chef?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>What grants the Crystals their magical power?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>And what are the mysterious Cappies?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The answers lie in the hearts — and appetites — of your guests.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4102900/extras/d32fd0ee362c7992f3dabe7e0560b963.poster.avif?t=1760733424\" width=1170 height=536 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4102900/extras/d32fd0ee362c7992f3dabe7e0560b963.webm?t=1760733424\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p>", "short_description": "Crystal Crepes: Tales of Food and Magic is a casual cooking and time-management game with visual novel elements. Discover a magical medieval world through the stories of multiple characters, and become the greatest Arcane Chef in Proxima Valyr!", "supported_languages": "English, Spanish - Latin America", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4102900/1a101d8c655d7bcf9bf46890677d527587638919/header.jpg?t=1760733424", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4102900/24b29d829453dd1bdef0b0a514a52d0f4c959a14/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1760733424", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4102900/24b29d829453dd1bdef0b0a514a52d0f4c959a14/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1760733424", "website": "https://www.partyrumble.com/projects/crystal-crepes", "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Quad Core Processor<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> <br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 11<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 3 GB available space</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 11<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Quad Core Processor<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 16 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> <br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 12<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 5 MB available space</li></ul>"}, "mac_requirements": [], "linux_requirements": [], "developers": ["Party Rumble Studio"], "publishers": ["Party Rumble Studio"], "package_groups": [], "platforms": {"windows": true, "mac": false, "linux": false}, "categories": [{"id": 2, "description": "Single-player"}, {"id": 62, "description": "Family Sharing"}], "genres": [{"id": "4", "description": "Casual"}], "screenshots": [{"id": 0, "path_thumbnail": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4102900/54d3af10ed5cf1d33642a64a85595cc204f18672/ss_54d3af10ed5cf1d33642a64a85595cc204f18672.600x338.jpg?t=1760733424", "path_full": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4